OL,3,CWoman charged following death of
OL,4,Cpedestrian in retail park collision
OL,6,FA woman has been charged with causing
OL,7,Fthe death by careless driving of a
OL,8,Fretired teacher at a retail park,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FThe emergency services responded to
OL,12,Freports that Rita Grimshaw, 81, had
OL,13,Fbeen in a collision with a vehicle as
OL,14,Fshe crossed a road outside a Marks and
OL,15,FSpencer store at Silverlink Retail
OL,16,FPark, North Tyneside, on 22 December.
OL,18,FShe was taken to hospital, but died
OL,19,Fthe following day.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
