OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1786370776
OL,3,CWoman charged following death of
OL,4,Cpedestrian in retail park collision
OL,6,FRelatives described her as a devoted
OL,7,Fmother, proud grandmother and a
OL,8,Fteacher for more than 30 years.
OL,10,FThey also described her as a "true
OL,11,Fpillar of the community", Northumbria
OL,12,FPolice said.
OL,14,FFollowing investigations, the force
OL,15,Fsaid Linda Hall, 64, of Murrayfiel,
OL,16,FSeghill, Northumberland, has been
OL,17,Fcharged with causing death by careless
OL,18,Fdriving.
OL,20,FShe will appear at North Tyneside
OL,21,FMagistrates' Court on 14 August.
OL,26,@rD@^OUsD@XO]
