CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1786370776
OL,3,CWoman charged following death of
OL,4,Cpedestrian in retail park collision
OL,6,FSergeant Dave Roberts, of Northumbria
OL,7,FPolice's Serious Collison
OL,8,FInvestigation Unit, said: "Our
OL,9,Fthoughts very much remain with Rita's
OL,10,Ffamily and loved ones, and we continue
OL,11,Fto offer them support following her
OL,12,Fdeath."
OL,14,FThe force continued to appeal for
OL,15,Fwitnesses who saw what happened to
OL,16,Fcome forward.
